Package: autospec
Title: Build fnctions from pseudo code Specifications
Version: 0.0.0.9
Author: Mark London
Maintainer: Mark London <mark.london@ons.gov.uk>
Description: Reads derived variable (DV) specification workbooks, drafts a plan
    matching each DV to a small library of building blocks, writes the plan
    as editable R code (the DV suite), and runs, checks and tests that suite
    against survey data. Written for the Wealth and Assets Survey; the survey
    conventions live in the config and the suite's settings.
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
Imports: 
    cli,
    data.table,
    openxlsx,
    readxl,
    stats,
    tools,
    utils,
    yaml
Suggests: 
    haven,
